# Infrastructure — local values (gitignored)

Copy this file to `INFRASTRUCTURE.local.md` and replace the placeholders.
`INFRASTRUCTURE.local.md` is gitignored; do not commit real addresses or secrets.

## Docker host

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Host | `REPLACE_WITH_LAN_HOST` |
| Role | Shared Docker host for this and other local projects |
| Reachability | Local LAN only |

## Occupied host ports

List other projects' bindings on that host so this project does not collide.

| Container | Image | Host port(s) |
| --- | --- | --- |
| *(other project)* | | `HOST_PORT` → 5432 |

## This project

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Suggested container name | `ai-repair-assistant-pg` |
| Image | `pgvector/pgvector:pg17` |
| Host port | `REPLACE_WITH_FREE_HOST_PORT` |
